# In plain English: what Docker leaves OUT of the image it builds. It starts by leaving out EVERYTHING ("*"), then lets in only the code
# and the list of libraries, so any new file, whatever its name, is not in the image unless it is added here on purpose
# (tests/test_allowed_build_files.py pins these lines). The cached files Python writes are left out again at the end.
*
!app
!requirements.txt
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
